      "historical_source_group": "TianJi",
      "physical_line_number": 2,
      "original_exact_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "天机出外遇贵居家有是非，巨门同动中则吉，天梁同出外称意，太阴同忙中吉，加羊陀火铃在外多是非身不安静。",
      "quote_SHA256": "7907ab51860dd7ca69ee66043b976d20e198377b42e13330c4199274799a8822",
      "quote_UTF8_bytes": 150,
      "original_codepoint_offset": 42617,
