      "historical_source_group": "WuQu",
      "physical_line_number": 4,
      "original_exact_Chinese_Wikitext_quote": "武曲闹忙中进少不宜静守，贪狼同作巨商，七杀破军同身心不得静守，加羊陀火铃在外招是非。",
      "quote_SHA256": "3cecaae207898af7960ece01348b0aeaba6f65cb25550a42a06589346524eb23",
